Detect SOD Violation -> Display Interactive Warning
Display Interactive Warning -> Submit Access with Justification
Submit Access with Justification -> Provision Access Request
Provision Access Request -> Run Nightly Refresh Task
Run Nightly Refresh Task -> Generate Detective Violation
Generate Detective Violation -> Violation Owner Reviews and Sets Sunset Date</pocket:flowchart>
